    summary: "Tissue processors, embedding stations, and microtomes (Sakura Tissue-Tek, Leica, Epredia) feed IHC/ISH autostainers (Roche VENTANA BenchMark ULTRA, Leica BOND, Agilent Dako Omnis, Sakura Tissue-Tek Genie) that run FDA-approved companion assays under locked protocols; staining platform, clone, and scoring guide are label-specific. Lab automation and tracking (barcoded cassettes and slides) reduce misidentification errors.",
